  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Made for 2560 x 1440p (16:9 aspect ratio)</Major>
    <Description>This macro is for the Ak in rust and was originally intended for 2560 x1440p but can also be used on 1920x1080p if you set your fov to 86.7 instead of 90

MUST use 0.885-0.89 sensetivity or it will NOT work!!!
 
You can tweak the fov for any improvements in recoil

</Description>
